{"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/destinations\/consoledestination\/enriched(by:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations","doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/ConsoleDestination"]]},"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"This destination, receiving each record with its context changed by ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"enricher"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"enriched"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"by"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"enricher"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Enricher","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Events8EnricherV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Enricher"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"some"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/Destination","preciseIdentifier":"s:12Destinations11DestinationP","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Destination"},{"kind":"text","text":"\n"}],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"What each record this destination receives adds to its context."}]}],"name":"enricher"}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"text":"Return Value","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"return-value"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A destination that hands this one each batch with its records enriched.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"codeListing","code":["let delivery = tracker.records.batch().deliver(","    to: ownBackend.enriched(by: Enricher { $0[RegionKey.self] = \"eu-west\" }),","    vendor",")"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The enricher runs on each record of a batch as the delivery hands the batch to this"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"destination, not on the tracker’s worker, so what it sets reaches this destination alone:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the others are handed the same records without it. It runs on every record the destination"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"receives, records a store recovered from an earlier run included, and reads any value it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"computes at delivery rather than when the event was tracked. So it suits values about the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"destination or the delivery, such as a region or a deployment tag, rather than about the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"event: a recovered record would get this run’s app version and the network at upload time."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Like the other modifiers, the one applied last sees each record first: in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"destination.enriched(by: first).enriched(by: second)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"second","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" runs, then "},{"code":"first","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", which"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"sees what "},{"code":"second","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" set and has the last word on a key both set."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Records the enricher adds before a record, as ","type":"text"},{"code":"Enricher.sessions()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" adds ","type":"text"},{"code":"SessionStarted","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and ","type":"text"},{"code":"SessionEnded","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", are left out: they would reach the destination without passing the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"tracker’s consent, samplers or store. Given such an enricher, this logs a warning once, as","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"it is called. Give that kind of enricher to the tracker instead.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"aside","name":"Complexity","style":"note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"O("},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"n"}]},{"type":"text","text":") enricher calls for a batch of "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"n","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" records."}]}]}],"kind":"content"}],"metadata":{"symbolKind":"method","roleHeading":"Instance Method","modules":[{"name":"Destinations"}],"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"enriched","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"by","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Enricher","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Events8EnricherV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Destination","preciseIdentifier":"s:12Destinations11DestinationP","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"title":"enriched(by:)","extendedModule":"Destinations","externalID":"s:12Destinations11DestinationPAAE8enriched2byQr6Events8EnricherV_tF::SYNTHESIZED::s:12Destinations18ConsoleDestinationV","remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Destinations\/Enriched.swift#L34","fileName":"Enriched.swift"},"role":"symbol"},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/ConsoleDestination\/enriched(by:)"},"references":{"doc://Destinations/documentation/Destinations":{"role":"collection","title":"Destinations","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documen